# Where the site actually answers. Every absolute URL in the pages — canonical,
# og:url, og:image — is built from this, because a share card that points at a
# domain which does not resolve yet shows no image at all.
#
# When vrom-eg.com is connected, change this one line to https://vrom-eg.com
# and redeploy. Nothing else needs touching.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://7amo2a2020.github.io/vrom-website
